{"id":63551,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:35:15","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:35:15","slug":"spt-urban-night-trail-alenquer","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/spt-urban-night-trail-alenquer\/","title":{"rendered":"SPT Urban Night Trail \u2013 Alenquer 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">SPT Urban Night Trail \u2013 Alenquer 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>SPT Urban Night Trail \u2013 Alenquer 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada instaladas no <strong>Largo Esp\u00edrito Santo<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico da vila de <strong>Alenquer<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>). Integrado na programa\u00e7\u00e3o natal\u00edcia de <em>Alenquer, Pres\u00e9pio de Portugal<\/em>, o evento \u00e9 coorganizado pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Alenquer<\/strong> e pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Sabores do Pa\u00e7o Trail<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo noturno tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>18:30<\/strong> (precedido de <em>briefing<\/em> obrigat\u00f3rio \u00e0s 18:15) e \u00e9 limitado a 1.000 participantes no conjunto das duas dist\u00e2ncias: o <strong>Trail Noturno de 13 km<\/strong>, de car\u00e1ter competitivo com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica e posto de abastecimento l\u00edquido\/s\u00f3lido aos 7 km, e a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong>, de vertente l\u00fadica (partida \u00e0s 18:35). O percurso percorre escadarias, ruelas iluminadas, quintas e trilhos envolventes da vila pres\u00e9pio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Dada a realiza\u00e7\u00e3o em hor\u00e1rio noturno, \u00e9 <strong>obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal<\/strong> em perfeito funcionamento e o transporte de recipiente de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o com capacidade m\u00ednima de <strong>0,5 L de \u00e1gua<\/strong> (evento ecossustent\u00e1vel sem copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica alusiva, dorsal, seguro de acidentes pessoais, refor\u00e7o final, bengaleiro e banhos no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Alenquer. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Largo Esp\u00edrito Santo, Alenquer, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Trail 13 km e Caminhada 8 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Munic\u00edpio de Alenquer e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Sabores do Pa\u00e7o Trail<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1hPSKmdHqJtgE6RFeHFSbcOGwe-2XAIvc\/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Noturno 13K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 30\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10 a 31\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 19.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 01\/12)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Noturna 8K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 30\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10 a 31\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 01\/12)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o SPT Urban Night Trail \u2013 Alenquer 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Largo Esp\u00edrito Santo, em Alenquer (distrito de Lisboa). O secretariado funciona no local das 17:00 \u00e0s 18:15, seguido de briefing \u00e0s 18:15 e partida do Trail de 13 km \u00e0s 18:30 (Caminhada \u00e0s 18:35).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para o Trail de 13 km: 14,00 \u20ac na 1\u00aa fase (1 a 30 de setembro), 16,00 \u20ac na 2\u00aa fase (1 a 31 de outubro) e 19,00 \u20ac na 3\u00aa fase (1 de novembro a 1 de dezembro). Para a Caminhada de 8 km: 9,00 \u20ac na 1\u00aa fase, 12,00 \u20ac na 2\u00aa fase e 13,00 \u20ac na 3\u00aa fase. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal, seguro, abastecimentos e brinde finisher.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que equipamento \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar para a prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De acordo com o regulamento oficial, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal em bom estado de funcionamento e o transporte de um recipiente com capacidade m\u00ednima de 0,5 litros de \u00e1gua, uma vez que n\u00e3o s\u00e3o disponibilizados copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem balne\u00e1rios, bengaleiro e pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00f5es?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza bengaleiro no local da partida\/chegada e banhos quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Alenquer. No Trail de 13 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, aos 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Sub-23 a M60) e \u00e0s 3 melhores equipas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e o limite de inscritos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento tem um limite global de 1.000 participantes. O Trail Noturno de 13 km \u00e9 reservado a atletas com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos (escal\u00f5es Sub-23, Seniores, M35, M40, M45, M50, M55 e M60+), enquanto a Caminhada de 8 km \u00e9 aberta a participantes de todas as idades.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"SPT Urban Night Trail \u2013 Alenquer 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo Esp\u00edrito Santo, Alenquer\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Alenquer\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de Alenquer e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Sabores do Pa\u00e7o Trail\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o SPT Urban Night Trail \u2013 Alenquer 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Largo Esp\u00edrito Santo, em Alenquer (distrito de Lisboa). O secretariado funciona no local das 17:00 \u00e0s 18:15, seguido de briefing \u00e0s 18:15 e partida do Trail de 13 km \u00e0s 18:30 (Caminhada \u00e0s 18:35).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Para o Trail de 13 km: 14,00 \u20ac na 1\u00aa fase (1 a 30 de setembro), 16,00 \u20ac na 2\u00aa fase (1 a 31 de outubro) e 19,00 \u20ac na 3\u00aa fase (1 de novembro a 1 de dezembro). Para a Caminhada de 8 km: 9,00 \u20ac na 1\u00aa fase, 12,00 \u20ac na 2\u00aa fase e 13,00 \u20ac na 3\u00aa fase. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal, seguro, abastecimentos e brinde finisher.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que equipamento \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar para a prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"De acordo com o regulamento oficial, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal em bom estado de funcionamento e o transporte de um recipiente com capacidade m\u00ednima de 0,5 litros de \u00e1gua, uma vez que n\u00e3o s\u00e3o disponibilizados copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem balne\u00e1rios, bengaleiro e pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00f5es?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza bengaleiro no local da partida\/chegada e banhos quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Alenquer. No Trail de 13 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, aos 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Sub-23 a M60) e \u00e0s 3 melhores equipas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e o limite de inscritos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento tem um limite global de 1.000 participantes. O Trail Noturno de 13 km \u00e9 reservado a atletas com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos (escal\u00f5es Sub-23, Seniores, M35, M40, M45, M50, M55 e M60+), enquanto a Caminhada de 8 km \u00e9 aberta a participantes de todas as idades.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70224,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63551","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-alenquer-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-spt-urban-night-trail-alenquer.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63551","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=63551"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63551\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70230,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63551\/revisions\/70230"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70224"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=63551"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=63551"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=63551"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=63551"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=63551"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=63551"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=63551"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}